{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "pagos-resilience-test-flow",
		"name": "Pagos Resilience Test Flow",
		"description": "# Pagos Microservice Resilience Test\n\nThis collection tests the system's resilience when the Pagos microservice is unavailable during payment processing.\n\n## Test Scenario:\n1. **Make Reservation** - Create a reservation and get the payment_intent_id\n2. **MANUAL STEP: Turn OFF Pagos microservice**\n3. **Process Payment in Ext-Service** - Complete the payment externally\n4. **Wait 5 minutes** - Allow time for retry mechanisms\n5. **MANUAL STEP: Turn ON Pagos microservice**\n6. **Verify Payment Status** - Confirm payment was updated in Pagos\n7. **Verify Reservation Status** - Confirm reservation status changed\n\n## How to Turn Off/On Pagos Microservice:\n\n### Using Docker Compose:\n```bash\n# Turn OFF (stop)\ndocker-compose stop pagos\n\n# Turn ON (start)\ndocker-compose start pagos\n```\n\n### Using Docker directly:\n```bash\n# Turn OFF\ndocker stop misw4501-202611-proyectofinal-grupo13-pagos-1\n\n# Turn ON\ndocker start misw4501-202611-proyectofinal-grupo13-pagos-1\n```",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url_gateway",
			"value": "http://localhost:8081",
			"type": "string"
		},
